                "description": "One of claimed, would-claim, skip-recent-commit, skip-claim-note, skip-open-pr, skip-closed or unknown, with the evidence per copy and the open PRs found. Exit 0 for claimed or would-claim, 1 for a skip, 2 for unknown. Unknown is never reported as free. With --json, `definitions.claimCheck` of schemas/skills/bean-drain/output.schema.json.",
